  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: (1) field initialisers `= new R(1)` and `= Helper` (method group) emit no instantiates/references edge, while the same expressions in a method do; (2) Loc() resolves to csharp:external:0-0:Loc:unresolved; (3) a field-like event E1 emits no symbol and E1(this,null) resolves to csharp:external:0-0:E1:unresolved. All three parts reproduce. The item could be split per decision. MECHANISM: instantiates/references arms lack INV-bamij type-body fallback; local_function_statement and event_field_declaration have no symbol branch. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-kajoh,WI-volus,WI-kokad."  # 7d41
